                             <h2>Legacy and Continued                           
                             Relevance</h2>\n    <p>\n                          
                             Despite patches being released by                  
                             Microsoft, many unpatched systems are              
                             still vulnerable to EternalBlue, and               
                             it remains in use by cybercriminals.               
                             The legacy of EternalBlue highlights               
                             the importance of regular system                   
                             updates and the potential dangers of               
                             stockpiling cyber weapons.\n                       
